rted, its error printed."] [241 1 "// localState is a _local's per-thread dicts and its constructor's arguments (localobject)."] [250 1 "// localDict makes o's dict the running thread's, made (and __init__ called again, as CPython's"] [251 1 "// _ldict) on the thread's first access."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[102 34] [167 34] [168 29] [191 51] [206 101] [207 37] [208 48] [235 32] [262 21] [272 56] [273 70] [408 40] [427 50] [590 38] [671 34] [710 30]]} (go/file "builtins_thread.go" :imports [


